title Vinyl: where nothing can change the volume, at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm) (the group shows --, its "+" says so in a notice) and the notice over the seek row (allow-small: the rows under 7 mm are warnings)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm, the harness's default for 640x480): the approved layout's touch rows are 70 px
# there, under the 7 mm (79 px): allow-small reports them as warnings (the owner's rule R-4) instead of failing
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_NOVOLUME 1

wait 1200
expect esc
expect text "--"
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 01-now-volume-unavailable
expect text "Volume is not available on this board"
expect noquit
